<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! Lararium Identity ~ the record

The identity law speaks at <<~ loulou uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/lararium-identity`>>; its dated rulings stand in that meme's <<~ loulou uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/lararium-identity#/rulings`>>. This record keeps what the law points to: the scouts, the syntheses, and the owed work.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/scouts`>>

!! Scouts

''Wire-C (Keyhive 0.1.0 scout, 2026-06-24) — the two layers COMPOSE, not duplicate.'' The scout found Keyhive's membership graph serving as the authority for the face↔device binding and revocation, with the `device-delegation` edge beside it as the offline projection. Its reading of the binding at that day: Group still could not round-trip in 0.1.0-alpha.3, so a Document-sentinel stood in; the Beelay JS ciphertext transport still blocked full multi-vessel.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/syntheses`>>

!! Syntheses

* ''The boundary rule'' (2026-06-25): four blind domains converged — crypto key-rotation · persona-unlinkability · immune/fungal commitment · institutional ceremony — on the HOLD/refound test (irreversible AND jointly-witnessed AND costly AND unlinkable).
* ''The lease'' (2026-06-25): four blind domains converged on the shape — DHCP soft-state · UCAN attenuation · quorum-sensing hysteresis · the institutional lease-not-ceremony.
* ''The veil + the lease — the design crystallized'' (2026-06-25, two research-swarms + the Elyncia/Shadowtalk/Mage fiction layer): anon stands a first-class veil, the crossing runs LIFT or HOLD on the boundary rule, decay rides native as the lease. Lift built (the edge); HOLD (refound-sever) named-unbuilt. The crossing CEREMONY rides a siege-gate (born-besieged; cost + witness + invite-graph Sybil-filter) and dissent/forking stays allowed but COSTLY (Mage-Paradox: cost parts a schism from a siege) — both to land in federation + dreamnet-architecture once the cost calibrates.
* ''The cost dial — synthesized'' (swarm complete, 2026-06-25): four blind domains (Sybil-graph defense · ZK-credential · immune costimulation · ritual/club economics) converged on the VOUCHER as the cost — MARGINAL-not-absolute (set the slope), invite-graph-relative (`rb>c`, the voucher supplies r), voucher-co-pays-and-watches, anergy-not-ban (no vouch → stay at floor=anon, re-presentable), entry-dear/maintenance-cheap/re-entry-costlier, group-value-tracking. The ZK-vouch rides the kahu as a blind oracle (carry rep across a HOLD without a link; price the HOLD at the staked rep). The mechanism stood unbuilt and contact-deferred (LIFT built; HOLD · siege-cost · ZK-vouch await the second spore).
* ''The contract performs the key-agreement'' (deep-domain grounded, 2026-06-24).
* ''The FS-limit'': the neg-entropy swarm refuted puncturable encryption for a replicated mesh; CORRECTION (2026-06-23): the earlier "threshold pays the kue" was wrong.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/owed`>>

!! Owed ~ for the kahu road

* ''The integer `boundEpoch` retires'' (approved 2026-11-12, not built). An edge will name the head digest of the PersonaGroup lineage it bound under, a causal link in place of a counter. Supersession rides acts (a Keyhive revoke, a kapae, a renewal record linked by digest), and a hard break forks as exit: a new PersonaGroup id, or a new seed charter for a hearth. No clock and no global count orders any of it.
* ''The porch answer'' (LAW THE BUILD OWES): R-WIRE owes answer carriage. The Kahu Plane road owes the floor's frozen seed-derived address and no-writer rule.
* ''HOLD's content half'' (a join that lifts nothing) and its choice at the door stand owed.

<<~/ahu>>

